● TASK RESULT
Implemented Step 4: Save-or-burn advisor + live win-probability bar.
### Changes
- **pipeline/build_model.py**: Python stdlib-only model builder — Bayesian-shrunk champion strengths (log-odds), team Elo (K=24), logistic regression (GD, L2 1e-3, 2000 iters, lr 0.1) on 4 features (elo, draft, blue, first_pick), 5-fold CV grouped by series_id. Outputs `web/public/data/model.json` (aggregates only).
- **tests/test_build_model.py**: 6 unittest tests — strong champion positive strength, Elo moves winner up, coefficients finite, no per-game rows, CV runs, meta fields.
- **web/src/model.js**: Pure `winProbability()` and `pickImpact()` functions using the model coefficients.
- **web/src/model.test.js**: 10 vitest tests covering probability bounds, Elo/draft effects, unknown teams/champs, parts summation, and pick impact.
- **web/src/advisor.js**: Save-or-burn advisor — computes value_now, future_cost, deny_value for top candidates; returns verdicts (take-now/save/deny) with plain-English reasons. Bo3/Bo5 aware, last-game handling.
- **web/src/advisor.test.js**: 10 vitest tests — deny case, save case, last-game case, burned/banned exclusion, graceful degradation.
- **web/src/components/WinBar.jsx**: Horizontal win% bar with team names, live updates, legend showing 4 contributing parts.
- **web/src/components/AdvisorPanel.jsx**: Recommendation list with verdict chips (Take now/Save/Deny), reasons, click-to-pick.
- **web/src/data.js**: Added `loadModel()` with graceful null fallback.
- **web/src/App.jsx**: Wired WinBar and AdvisorPanel into the app layout.
- **web/src/styles.css**: Added responsive styles for win-bar and advisor components.
- **README.md**: Added step 4 documentation section, marked roadmap item 4 as done.
### Verification
- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`: 13/13 tests passed
- `cd web && npx vitest run`: 29/29 tests passed
- `cd web && npx vite build`: built successfully
- `python3 pipeline/build_model.py`: produced model.json (154 champions, 44 teams, CV accuracy=0.638)
### Notes
- Model gracefully degrades: app hides WinBar/AdvisorPanel if model.json is missing
- Unknown teams default to Elo 1500, unknown champions to strength 0
